  "ruleText": "Pda 502.08 “Commercial vessel affidavit” means the notarized documentation submitted to and accepted by the New Hampshire department of safety pursuant to RSA 270-E:2, II(e).\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.10) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
